Conflicts: fsearch
Replaces: fsearch
Description: FSearch using the shared TemplarOS file index
 Graphical file search backed by org.templaros.Files.Index1. This distribution
 build contains no local index scanner, database storage, or filesystem monitor.
 Folder policy and freshness belong to the shared file service and Settings.
